<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Hệ thống Quản lý Cuộc thi Sinh viên</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Web_cham_diem.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Styles", required: false)

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        .custom-header-container {
            display: flex !important;
            flex-wrap: nowrap !important;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 100%;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .brand-zone {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            min-width: 260px;
        }

        .menu-zone {
            display: flex !important;
            flex-direction: row !important;
            flex-wrap: nowrap !important;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
            padding: 0 !important;
            list-style: none;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

            .menu-zone .nav-link {
                display: flex !important;
                align-items: center;
                white-space: nowrap !important;
                padding: 8px 12px !important;
                font-size: 13px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                color: #212529 !important;
                transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
            }

                .menu-zone .nav-link:hover {
                    background-color: #fff5f5;
                    color: #dc3545 !important;
                }

                .menu-zone .nav-link.active {
                    color: #dc3545 !important;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    background-color: #fff1f2;
                }

        /* Auth Zone - Phía bên phải */
        .auth-zone {
            display: flex !important;
            flex-wrap: nowrap !important;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            align-items: center;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

            .auth-zone .btn {
                white-space: nowrap !important;
                padding: 8px 16px !important;
                font-size: 13px;
            }

        /* User Profile Container */
            .user-profile-wrapper {
                display: flex !important;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                border-radius: 25px;
                background-color: #f8f9fa;
                transition: all 0.3s ease;
                cursor: pointer;
                border: none;
                outline: none;
                background-clip: padding-box;
                appearance: none;
            }

                .user-profile-wrapper:hover {
                    background-color: #e9ecef;
                    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
                }

            .dropdown-menu-user {
                min-width: 320px !important;
                border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
                border-radius: 8px;
                box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
                margin-top: 8px;
                z-index: 1050;
            }

        .user-avatar-small {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545, #ff6b6b);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border: 2px solid white;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .user-info-compact {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .user-fullname-compact {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #212529;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .user-email-compact {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        /* Dropdown Menu */
        .dropdown-menu-user {
            min-width: 320px !important;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .dropdown-header-user {
            padding: 1.25rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }

        .dropdown-user-card-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .user-avatar-large {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 20px;
            border: 2px solid white;
        }

        .dropdown-user-info {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .dropdown-user-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: white;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .dropdown-user-email {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .dropdown-user-role {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .dropdown-menu-user .dropdown-divider {
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .dropdown-item-user {
            padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem !important;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #212529;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

            .dropdown-item-user:hover {
                background-color: #f8f9fa;
                color: #dc3545;
                border-left-color: #dc3545;
                transform: translateX(2px);
            }

            .dropdown-item-user i {
                width: 18px;
                color: #dc3545;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

        .dropdown-item-logout {
            color: #dc3545 !important;
        }

            .dropdown-item-logout:hover {
                background-color: #ffe5e5 !important;
            }

        /* Login/Register Buttons */
        .btn-outline-danger.rounded-pill:hover {
            background-color: #dc3545;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.15);
        }

        .btn-danger.rounded-pill:hover {
            background-color: #bb2d3b !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .topbar-links a {
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

            .topbar-links a:hover {
                color: #ffc107 !important;
            }

        .main-footer a {
            color: #b3b3b3 !important;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

            .main-footer a:hover {
                color: #ffc107 !important;
            }

        /* Responsive */
        @@media (max-width: 992px) {
            .user-info-compact

        {
            display: none !important;
        }

        .menu-zone {
            display: none !important;
        }

        .custom-header-container {
            gap: 8px;
        }

        }

        @@media (max-width: 576px) {
            .brand-zone

        {
            min-width: auto;
        }

        .auth-zone {
            gap: 4px;
        }

            .auth-zone .btn {
                padding: 6px 10px !important;
                font-size: 12px;
            }

        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100 bg-light">

    <header class="main-header shadow-sm bg-white">
        <div class="topbar py-1 bg-dark text-white font-monospace" style="font-size: 13px;">
            <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <div>
                    <i class="bi bi-telephone-fill text-warning me-2"></i>Hotline Hỗ Trợ: <strong>1800.XXXX (Miễn phí)</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="topbar-links d-none d-md-flex gap-3">
                    <a href="/HuongDan" class="text-white text-decoration-none"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>Hướng dẫn đăng ký thi</a>
                    <a href="/LichTrinh" class="text-white text-decoration-none"><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i>Lịch trình cuộc thi</a>
                    <a href="/TinTuc" class="text-white text-decoration-none"><i class="bi bi-newspaper me-1"></i>Tin tức & Sự kiện</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light py-2 border-bottom">
            <div class="container-fluid custom-header-container">

                <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center brand-zone" href="/">
                    <img src="~/images/logo-uni.png" alt="Logo" width="40" class="me-2" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/40'">
                    <div>
                        <span class="fw-bold text-danger d-block lh-1" style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;">HỆ THỐNG QUẢN LÝ CUỘC THI</span>
                        <small class="text-secondary fw-semibold d-none d-sm-block" style="font-size: 10px;">ĐẠI HỌC CÔNG NGHỆ & KHẢO THÍ</small>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <ul class="menu-zone fw-semibold">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/Competitions">
                            <i class="bi bi-trophy me-1 text-danger"></i>
                            <span class="d-none d-lg-inline">Cuộc thi</span>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/Teams">
                            <i class="bi bi-people me-1 text-primary"></i>
                            <span class="d-none d-lg-inline">Đội thi</span>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                  

                    @if (User.IsInRole("Organizer"))
                    {
                        @* <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="/Competitive/Rules">
                                <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text me-1 text-danger"></i>
                                <span class="d-none d-lg-inline">Tạo luật lệ</span>
                            </a>
                        </li> *@

                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="/Organizer/Dashboard">
                                <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line me-1 text-warning"></i>
                                <span class="d-none d-lg-inline">Trang ban tổ chức</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    }
                </ul>

                @{
                    var isAuthenticated = User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated ?? false;
                    var userFullName = User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Name)?.Value ?? "Người dùng";
                    var userEmail = User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Email)?.Value ?? "";
                    var userRole = User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Role)?.Value ?? "Student";
                    var userInitial = !string.IsNullOrEmpty(userFullName)
                    ? string.Concat(userFullName.Split(' ').Select(x => x[0])).ToUpper()
                    : "U";
                }

                <div class="auth-zone">
                    @if (isAuthenticated)
                    {
                        <!-- User Profile Dropdown - Phía bên phải -->
                        <div class="dropdown">
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="user-profile-wrapper dropdown-toggle"
                                    data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-bs-auto-close="outside">
                                <div class="user-avatar-small" title="@userFullName">
                                    @userInitial
                                </div>
                                <div class="user-info-compact d-none d-lg-flex">
                                    <span class="user-fullname-compact">@userFullName</span>
                                    <span class="user-email-compact">@userEmail</span>
                                </div>
                                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-muted" style="font-size: 12px;"></i>
                            </button>

                            <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dropdown-menu-user">
                                <li class="dropdown-header-user">
                                    <div class="dropdown-user-card-header">
                                        <div class="user-avatar-large">@userInitial</div>
                                        <div class="dropdown-user-info">
                                            <div class="dropdown-user-name">@userFullName</div>
                                            <div class="dropdown-user-email">@userEmail</div>
                                            <div class="dropdown-user-role">
                                                <i class="bi bi-shield me-1" style="font-size: 10px;"></i>@userRole
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </li>

                                <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/Profile">
                                        <i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i>
                                        <span>Hồ sơ cá nhân</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/MyCompetitions">
                                        <i class="bi bi-bookmark-heart"></i>
                                        <span>Cuộc thi của tôi</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/MySubmissions">
                                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-arrow-up"></i>
                                        <span>Bài nộp của tôi</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/MyScores">
                                        <i class="bi bi-graph-up"></i>
                                        <span>Kết quả chấm điểm</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/Settings">
                                        <i class="bi bi-gear"></i>
                                        <span>Cài đặt tài khoản</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user" href="/Help">
                                        <i class="bi bi-question-circle"></i>
                                        <span>Trợ giúp</span>
                                    </a>
                                </li>

                                <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>

                                <li>
                                    <form asp-controller="Login" asp-action="Logout" method="post" style="margin: 0;">
                                        <button type="submit"
                                                class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-user dropdown-item-logout w-100 text-start"
                                                style="border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer;">
                                            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i>
                                            <span>Đăng xuất</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </form>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <!-- Login & Register Buttons - Phía bên phải khi chưa đăng nhập -->
                        <a href="/Login" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm rounded-pill d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i>
                            <span class="d-none d-sm-inline">Đăng nhập</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/Register" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm rounded-pill d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-person-plus"></i>
                            <span class="d-none d-sm-inline">Đăng ký</span>
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>

            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main role="main" class="flex-grow-1 @(ViewData["UseFluidContainer"] as bool? == true ? "container-fluid px-0" : "container my-4")">
        @if (TempData["SuccessMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show mt-3" role="alert">
                <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-2"></i>
                <strong>Thành công!</strong> @TempData["SuccessMessage"]
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
        }
        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    <footer class="main-footer bg-dark text-light-50 pt-5 pb-3 mt-auto border-top border-4 border-danger" style="background-color: #1a1a1a !important; color: #b3b3b3;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                    <h5 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3 border-bottom border-danger pb-2 d-inline-block">VỀ HỆ THỐNG</h5>
                    <p class="small text-justify" style="line-height: 1.6;">
                        Hệ thống quản lý cuộc thi và xét duyệt kết quả sinh viên trực tuyến, tối ưu hóa quy trình đăng ký, nộp bài đề tài nghiên cứu, chấm điểm từ hội đồng giám khảo và kết xuất báo cáo thống kê chính xác, minh bạch.
                    </p>
                    <div class="social-links d-flex gap-3 mt-3">
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-facebook text-primary"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-youtube text-danger"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-globe2 text-info"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
                    <h5 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3 border-bottom border-danger pb-2 d-inline-block">TIỆN ÍCH</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small d-grid gap-2">
                        <li><a href="/Activity/Competitions" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Tất cả cuộc thi</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/Activity/Guidelines" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Thể lệ tham gia</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/Activity/Criteria" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Tiêu chí chấm điểm</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/Activity/Statistics" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Thống kê số liệu</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                    <h5 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3 border-bottom border-danger pb-2 d-inline-block">QUY ĐỊNH & BẢO MẬT</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small d-grid gap-2">
                        <li><a href="/Terms" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Điều khoản sử dụng</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/Privacy" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Chính sách bảo mật</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/AntiCheat" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Cơ chế chống gian lận</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/Support" class="text-decoration-none text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right me-1 small"></i>Giải đáp thắc mắc</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                    <h5 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3 border-bottom border-danger pb-2 d-inline-block">BAN TỔ CHỨC</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small d-grid gap-2 text-white-50">
                        <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill text-danger mt-1"></i>
                            <span>Phòng Quản lý Khoa học & Công nghệ, Tòa nhà Trung tâm, Trường Đại học.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-envelope-fill text-warning"></i>
                            <span>khoahocsinhvien@university.edu.vn</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-building-fill text-info"></i>
                            <span>Văn phòng: Tầng 3 - P.302</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="my-4 border-secondary">

            <div class="row align-items-center">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 text-center text-md-start small text-white-50">
                    &copy; 2026 Hệ thống Quản lý Cuộc thi Sinh viên. Phát triển dựa trên nền tảng ASP.NET Core & Postgresql.
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 text-center text-md-end small mt-2 mt-md-0 text-white-50">
                    Mã nguồn dự án thuộc bản quyền ban đề tài nghiên cứu cấp Trường.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>